  "post_title": "Expo de Andre Dilara en el restaurant L'Horta Nova del Club de Campo Onda",
  "post_date": "2016-08-12 09:24:12",
  "post_name": "expo-de-andre-dilara-en-el-restaurant-lhorta-nova-del-club-de-campo-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Economía|Noticias|Sociedad|Turismo",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_3160.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(54 fotos) El restaurant L&#39;Horta Nova, en el Club de Campo de Onda, ha acogido la tarde-noche de este jueves la inauguraci&oacute;n de la exposici&oacute;n Caos, obras abstractas en t&eacute;cnicas mixtas de Andre Dilara, nombre art&iacute;stico de Andreea Ciurea.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_3204.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La pintora y modelo ahora afincada en Vila-real ha pintado en directo un cuadro, sorteado entre aquellas personas que han degustado la tapa con base de steak tartar, elaborada por el cocinero David Alguacil Sol&aacute;. El agraciado ha sido Nadal Escrig Gonz&aacute;lez.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/ProgramacioRestLhortaNovaClubCampOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 332px;\" /></p>\n<p>Durante todo el verano, L&#39;Horta Nova presenta una completa programaci&oacute;n cultural y musical, con tardeos los mi&eacute;rcoles de 20 a 22 horas y verm&uacute;s los domingos de 12 a 14 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3117.jpg\" alt=\"img_3117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3120.jpg\" alt=\"img_3120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3123.jpg\" alt=\"img_3123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3125.jpg\" alt=\"img_3125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3126.jpg\" alt=\"img_3126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3128.jpg\" alt=\"img_3128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3131.jpg\" alt=\"img_3131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3132.jpg\" alt=\"img_3132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3136.jpg\" alt=\"img_3136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3137.jpg\" alt=\"img_3137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3140.jpg\" alt=\"img_3140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3142.jpg\" alt=\"img_3142\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3143.jpg\" alt=\"img_3143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3146.jpg\" alt=\"img_3146\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredilaraadreeaciurealhortanova/img_3147.jpg\" alt=\"img_3147\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoandredil